ealthkey-ai/promop/commit/753401bb4661da2b12a98883965087e528cd0440","sha":"753401bb4661da2b12a98883965087e528cd0440","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/753401bb4661da2b12a98883965087e528cd0440"}],"sha":"d30ef862f566ff1944eb9bcf82a0e9d34ebd4a2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/d30ef862f566ff1944eb9bcf82a0e9d34ebd4a2d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23161?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adamblum","id":23161,"login":"adamblum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/753401bb4661da2b12a98883965087e528cd0440/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:52:45Z","email":"adam@healthkey.ai","name":"Adam Blum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T10:52:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge Blood tab into Labs tab (#1759)\n\n* Merge Blood tab into Labs tab (#1758)\n\nBlood counts are now the first section of the Labs tab, reducing the\ntab count by one. BloodTab.tsx and its test are removed. The federation\nPatientInfo.tsx and both save-test files are updated to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix save tests: mock useLabMeasurements for LabsTab\n\nThe save tests render PatientDetail/PatientInfo which now include LabsTab\n(after merging Blood tab into Labs). LabsTab uses useLabMeasurements which\nrequires QueryClientProvider. Add the mock to both save test files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Adam Blum <23161+adamblum@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e74484774798c748fcd39acd4fd1a6bfe9f7c7ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/e74484774798c748fcd39acd4fd1a6bfe9f7c7ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/753401bb4661da2b12a98883965087e528cd0440","verification":{"payload":"tree e74484774798c748fcd39acd4fd1a6bfe9f7c7ba\nparent 2643d5572a93539c5e5a54db0a94ad708e92646e\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1791456765 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791456765 +0100\n\nMerge Blood tab into Labs tab (#1759)\n\n* Merge Blood tab into Labs tab (#1758)\n\nBlood counts are now the first section of the Labs tab, reducing the\ntab count by one. BloodTab.tsx and its test are removed. The federation\nPatientInfo.tsx and both save-test files are updated to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Fix save tests: mock useLabMeasurements for LabsTab\n\nThe save tests render PatientDetail/PatientInfo which now include LabsTab\n(after merging Blood tab into Labs). LabsTab uses useLabMeasurements which\nrequires QueryClientProvider. Add the mock to both save test files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Adam Blum <23161+adamblum@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx3X9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIk8QAHe1qs4YSichpxrMsTTEPAnH\n4FpX+8ljVXuNkQ8yyAPDNnVhDeFA04PTTXs7Y1jO6nl2Ll