ncePanel.tsx: collapse facilities list when > 3 items\n  with a \"Show N more\" toggle\n\nThe dialog manages its own state (form, concept search, suggest-one,\ndestination options, lock acquisition/release) and communicates with\nthe parent through onSaved/onDeleted/onBanner callbacks.\n\nCo-authored-by: Adam Blum <23161+adamblum@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"533cda6ea5cff620d9e1ffa580a93808adf203ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/533cda6ea5cff620d9e1ffa580a93808adf203ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/2643d5572a93539c5e5a54db0a94ad708e92646e","verification":{"payload":"tree 533cda6ea5cff620d9e1ffa580a93808adf203ff\nparent 21742005a40119a8e25c09327c05be5e9f469a41\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1791456312 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791456312 +0100\n\nrefactor: extract EditMappingDialog from CodeMappingPage (#1757) (#1760)\n\nExtract the ~600-line inline edit/new mapping dialog from\nCodeMappingPage.tsx into a standalone EditMappingDialog component,\nwith shared types and constants in codeMappingTypes.ts.\n\n- CodeMappingPage.tsx: 3068 -> 1779 lines (42% reduction)\n- PatientSourceCodesTab.tsx: replaces InlineDestinationPicker and\n  NewMappingPicker with EditMappingDialog\n- SourceEvidencePanel.tsx: collapse facilities list when > 3 items\n  with a \"Show N more\" toggle\n\nThe dialog manages its own state (form, concept search, suggest-one,\ndestination options, lock acquisition/release) and communicates with\nthe parent through onSaved/onDeleted/onBanner callbacks.\n\nCo-authored-by: Adam Blum <23161+adamblum@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx3Q4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAw7YQAIYgliroK1Dgljp3zn/I4zGU\nO4gIWS/Uo9dzQAwV47CF1EiSN6n+3AM5jApbx+crW7wReFfMeSx2jyPhtS4SuZyM\nwShpgxo9TcxLJN3cu