ed_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vtrv101/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vtrv101/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vtrv101","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/28da5c057020b64889b00053a58a0670635da3d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:42:49Z","email":"vtrv101@gmail.com","name":"Vladimir Tarasov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T08:42:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix the FLC ratio when one light chain is stored and one projected (#1756)\n\nrefresh_patient_record holds a freshly projected free light chain as a\nfloat, while one kept from the stored record is the Decimal the database\nreturned. When only one was re-projected, the involved/uninvolved ratio and\nthe IMWG measurable-disease check divided a float by a Decimal and raised\nTypeError, failing the whole refresh. Read both as floats.\n\nFound seeding a sample patient on staging with real LOINC concepts.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0569134501c7c0f4cee695cb440590b7b40497a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/0569134501c7c0f4cee695cb440590b7b40497a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/28da5c057020b64889b00053a58a0670635da3d6","verification":{"payload":"tree 0569134501c7c0f4cee695cb440590b7b40497a5\nparent d4705c81e2ae0e4dcd84b761d4c5b51191a90e1b\nauthor Vladimir Tarasov <vtrv101@gmail.com> 1791448969 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791448969 +0100\n\nFix the FLC ratio when one light chain is stored and one projected (#1756)\n\nrefresh_patient_record holds a freshly projected free light chain as a\nfloat, while one kept from the stored record is the Decimal the database\nreturned. When only one was re-projected, the involved/uninvolved ratio and\nthe IMWG measurable-disease check divided a float by a Decimal and raised\nTypeError, failing the whole refresh. Read both as floats.\n\nFound seeding a sample patient on staging with real LOINC concepts.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx1eJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAh4cQADQ8U5gHmMGuE9I11ZtjfZip\nXLqUOaPGdGRs+BDPkLAD2U2vfB/oRA95EP3j7C5CM7uMNIGy3LT4/tMc4VspOMKz\naz/t9l3M1zb6DnD8TpBpLLzj17p18HwbnrBiBEa3hJwP3q2lfHWjrVEQBz0gTDQn\nfi7fx99QwymimLpHTXJ5NJJ32/LAih5n1tWMRVp9Y6YXg4M3v41kCx1vebO9ROjW\nbxEptOV1SbZx9y4cR002mwSm1SLwV14Pbt48G5t3bzeHEacRHGrkA7J8uYaoEfCI\nL1JOo9LrlaEYigNo5hlIO6VLYttOtEbSk2XNQoLQYSS65IYvHsAF+K/vBsAkQGuc\nVq6lNkJOu/ooHwLjvE7aTyhu1S0Pf/8zNcbxDRWozfCyVdIH0Jw5T9rTjli88D0l\n1xa5znvoXngsbgu1H764ZT21/Pcvo0lz2R2cPEK0jHC+5Q3Veknx88QQjHjlJsRg\nmrmTWiguVCPkaxF3tvJmHL05AjANDCqAKSZlijFSk5oU4Y04GHCDP0ODCJw+y6/F\nNK9Kj9aV0B4qvnc0TKlBSFgXWYp4Goky5oHamfJ3lawhkUjT2mp3tyFNsHMDUX3K\nEA112uvhywFSp1FAWPFbymLqJJ6KkkbMICP7/N122Gy/cKxro22gn9Iw/j6oWtQM\nYFr31EwqCroEM4KiiI1d\n=NLat\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-08T08:42:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/promop/commit/28da5c057020b64889b00053a58a0670635da3d6","node_id":"C_kwDOPw6uhdoAKDI4ZGE1YzA1NzAyMGI2NDg4OWIwMDA1M2E1OGEwNjcwNjM1ZGEzZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/promop/commit/d4705c81e2ae0e4dcd84b761d4c5b51191a90e1b","sha":"d4705c81e2ae0e4dcd84b761d4c5b51191a90e1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/d4705c81e2ae0e4dcd84b761d4c5b51191a90e1b"}],"sha":"28da5c057020b64889b00053a58a0670635da3d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/28da5c057020b64889b00053a58a0670635da3d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23161?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adamblum","id":23161,"login":"adamblum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/d4705c81e2ae0e4dcd84b761d4c5b51191a90e1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:07:32Z","email":"adam@healthkey.ai","name":"Adam Blum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:07:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(patient-source-codes): open inline edit mapping dialog instead of navigating (#1755)\n\nClicking a source code row on the patient Source Codes tab now opens an\ninline destination picker below the row, instead of navigating to the\nCode Mappings page. For rows that already have an SCCM mapping, the\nexisting InlineDestinationPicker is shown. For unmapped rows, a new\nNewMappingPicker creates the SCCM row via POST when the user saves\ntheir destination choice.\n\nAlso reverts the ?search= URL param on CodeMappingPage added in #1753.\n\nCloses #1752\n\nCo-authored-by: Adam Blum <23161+adamblum@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eadd8639d6f0c24a558732969cbf264152d51a81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/eadd8639d6f0c24a558732969cbf264152d51a81"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/d4705c81e2ae0e4dcd84b761d4c5b51191a90e1b","verification":{"payload":"tree eadd8639d6f0c24a558732969cbf264152d51a81\nparent 150ab86d21053cf3da4112b00660b038e009e0cb\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1791403652 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791403652 +0100\n\nfix(patient-source-codes): open inline edit mapping dialog instead of navigating (#1755)\n\nClicking a source code row on the patient Source Codes tab now opens an\ninline destination picker below the row, instead of navigating to the\nCode Mappings page. For rows that already have an SCCM mapping, the\nexisting InlineDestinationPicker is shown. For unmapped rows, a new\nNewMappingPicker creates the SCCM row via POST when the user saves\ntheir destination choice.\n\nAlso reverts the ?search= URL param on CodeMappingPage added in #1753.\n\nCloses #1752\n\nCo-authored-by: Adam Blum <23161+adamblum@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxqaECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFf0QABr57YXfXLPEoMSN5j5Q+bZX\nBMzj63GQ714z9V3gdO0yjAIilw8