thub.com/users/adamblum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adamblum","id":23161,"login":"adamblum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/75e6084832276b8d4f962ebca4d5802394e43dbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:22:27Z","email":"adam@healthkey.ai","name":"Adam Blum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T15:22:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: DATABASE_URL in .env is production (#1726)\n\nCLAUDE.md said both .env database URLs point at staging. DATABASE_URL is\nproduction, so a bare manage.py command and every\n${STAGING_DATABASE_URL:-$DATABASE_URL} fallback reached production.\nName staging explicitly with :?, label read-only production checks, warn\nthat copy_reference_data/copy_patient write to DATABASE_URL, and note\n.env''s single SECRET_KEY matches at most one deployment.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c61c24135acee627e3fdd4eb22c98b1a6df401a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/6c61c24135acee627e3fdd4eb22c98b1a6df401a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/75e6084832276b8d4f962ebca4d5802394e43dbf","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c61c24135acee627e3fdd4eb22c98b1a6df401a\nparent 5a9364bf2d07b06a580e7a9d870ac725e1651937\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1791127347 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791127347 +0100\n\ndocs: DATABASE_URL in .env is production (#1726)\n\nCLAUDE.md said both .env database URLs point at staging. DATABASE_URL is\nproduction, so a bare manage.py command and every\n${STAGING_DATABASE_URL:-$DATABASE_URL} fallback reached production.\nName staging explicitly with :?, label read-only production checks, warn\nthat copy_reference_data/copy_patient write to DATABASE_URL, and note\n.env''s single SECRET_KEY matches at most one deployment.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwm8zCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAi5AQAK85CKo+3PA19IxhyOAjkrss\nhO6LdMIL+u9zOUmwL3i9lWPpp2z3g5eAyrYUJfSNUavmFrhdeAPJylwBeCVmGdp2\nwQiLFL7PBp+9B5K43OQJpkKqxAgB/E8yq8u4gGxiRqmO0lfG4snAaO/4SsRh7Auf\nMWUOQi/cNBCh8WRcHkOSM0EWGJZq967+KWhBYXijKok0EtqRxSLdykGO14OjeSIL\n5cHGLcVs8eF3g8LHMRmH1s0YQoJCZDl0YirzMqQPS4lHQX/vqft+3ke36YQIQP6N\n0kH0vsR0iY5VzUlk8sNJnuX15lbG4o+arpKGJOaVLo0GjXXA/5ohPb4DnMlK7OKX\nW4MTbuzdvMct8NtyhoLB9/xl+20v/EZ/treQXAGSrw/Eu+DcQiwNFOFsAs0d5VQk\nNBgGgZhCmm9wTIMnDPeGs8VJYFConFcHE+3oL+DmcJQJeAlBs+cr+YorAORvobdQ\nv/uVRFw9lxLl3ER8AZbf6hgu9Vkm+tpIQ1+d/TnM6ne18m7Hj/iXVWTDyPKsOkcd\ngelUqv+UbSqA0QFU0aRu9eA0NZLgM408dCoOP3tRzEtxDemIVEtJc4/P8aU717JH\nRIF91KOTOf5pxsaNHbSlWIWk0SA+B3z4rzryEeCpuHpxLRkQIYvGF2h3BEzFnFqe\n/Gdn8wwXFoDIshkv6LnG\n=SHUz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T15:22:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://