oved (#1714)\n\n* Keep genomics fields editable when their mapping is not approved (#1713)\n\nThe writer, the genomics catalog and the write descriptor now gate on\nthe field''s recipe (table + source value), not its review status.\nUntil a mapping is approved its facts are stored under the recipe''s\nsource code as concept 0; approval lets the mapped concept flow forward.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Read genomics recipes in the curated-mapping query\n\nKeeps build_writable_field_descriptor''s query count unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"511acc6c068773ae908fc4a5cbcee19e3db5e2b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/511acc6c068773ae908fc4a5cbcee19e3db5e2b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/126e44bd5e333e19707ba7521cef87f9ef58ac4e","verification":{"payload":"tree 511acc6c068773ae908fc4a5cbcee19e3db5e2b2\nparent 10959af07e5a082da2c902b8f1040597d92b872e\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1791105081 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791105081 +0100\n\nKeep genomics fields editable when their mapping is not approved (#1714)\n\n* Keep genomics fields editable when their mapping is not approved (#1713)\n\nThe writer, the genomics catalog and the write descriptor now gate on\nthe field''s recipe (table + source value), not its review status.\nUntil a mapping is approved its facts are stored under the recipe''s\nsource code as concept 0; approval lets the mapped concept flow forward.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Read genomics recipes in the curated-mapping query\n\nKeeps build_writable_field_descriptor''s query count unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M cont