uhdoAKDEyNmU0NGJkNWUzMzNlMTk3MDdiYTc1MjFjZWY4N2Y5ZWY1OGFjNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/promop/commit/10959af07e5a082da2c902b8f1040597d92b872e","sha":"10959af07e5a082da2c902b8f1040597d92b872e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/10959af07e5a082da2c902b8f1040597d92b872e"}],"sha":"126e44bd5e333e19707ba7521cef87f9ef58ac4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/126e44bd5e333e19707ba7521cef87f9ef58ac4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23161?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adamblum","id":23161,"login":"adamblum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/10959af07e5a082da2c902b8f1040597d92b872e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:08:46Z","email":"adam@healthkey.ai","name":"Adam Blum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T09:08:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Link patient fields to their field mapping, and mappings to source codes (#1716)\n\n* Link patient fields to their field mapping, and mappings to source codes (#1715)\n\nFor staff and org admins, each patient-editor field shows a globe that\nopens /field-mappings?field=<name>, which switches to the field''s tab\nand opens its concept dialog. That dialog''s {codes} button, beside\n\"Selected:\", opens /code-mappings?direction=reverse&concept=<id>: the\nConcept -> Source Code view with the concept''s \"Source codes for\" dialog\nopen on Find source codes.\n\nThe globe is driven by a context the patient page sets once; useAuth\nfetches per call and a tab renders dozens of fields.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Address review: open linked concept by id, expand computed, link once\n\n- Fetch the linked concept from its detail endpoint. The list''s text\n  search also matches the id''s digits in names and codes, so the concept\n  could sort past the first page and read as \"not a standard concept\".\n- A linked unmappable field expands its collapsed section.\n- The linked concept is used once; switching direction no longer reopens it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06817dd402a11ff00137726d5f920c4afac9b09c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/06817dd402a11ff00137726d5f920c4afac9b09c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/10959af07e5a082da2c902b8f1040597d92b872e","verification":{"payload":"tree 06817dd402a11ff00137726d5f920c4afac9b09c\nparent 528137b943cdd008eb9734ffc3ec010b942ce7e4\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1791104926 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791104926 +0100\n\nLink patient fields to their field mapping, and mappings to source codes (#1716)\n\n* Link patient fields to their field mapping, and mappings to source codes (#1715)\n\nFor staff and org admins, each patient-editor field shows a globe that\nopens /field-mappings?field=<name>, which switches to the field''s tab\nand opens its concept dialog. That dialog''s {codes} button, beside\n\"Selected:\", opens /code-mappings?direction=reverse&concept=<id>: the\nConcept -> Source Code view with the concept''s \"Source codes for\" dialog\nopen on Find source codes.\n\nThe globe is driven by a context the patient page sets once; useAuth\nfetches per call and a tab renders dozens of fields.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Address review: open linked concept by id, expand computed, link once\n\n- Fetch the linked concept from its detail endpoint. The list''s text\n  search also matches the id''s digits in names and codes, so the concept\n  could sort past the first page and read as \"not a standard concept\".\n- A linked unmappable field expands its collapsed section.\n- The linked concept is used once; switching direction no longer reopens it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwheeCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAE4wQAFT7h0lVCIYY00jz0vG6q0tL\nzzWIMRuOomzFnShGaUm32VmoMU9xqtJMIuOOhQSMmtEt55DdvHpFHItnGTXhM7mr\n90bQOUyMuHMWFcZPeBlSAK6oL+vObihdT6PFZoXOnxwFJaFN4DU5Bg4s/Hia02Hm\nPg1DKyOnCyHhKMqMQWSDgg+NZiolmPfdGkidtyGzUg0uAyd0vnOp4IGWsMjPvVFx\ndbX7tbXWDekguANKkf9jrp6TSIF36ROZoNLq07fDZDEQUTVecaVN/9xItXKbhzya\n0wNFxm3YkoEJOOJ+n/td1XTyeT/92htQ2rBXr9DZlfBArVeNdEGVL1tN/+rs4LFz\nu9oUjF4GisWkgYOS7CuZ1X5g3eoNrNIG5cLmf6i/PnhtQcWMtikD9l44XKI8IMWt\nesgoLTWZLyrUHbe02Fc8egcQzGlWOquI2u9r3BEZBSa04CP/CWEcj/NXlaEptUdc\nVNFsybEBUX72THoZYwEnavcqDAV2f/Ewt64nb9oECI213Q5q1VNTGMVSTyNvXlNC\nUfjp7JmutuIyoX9/zcGMhORQvOwlwhwQZqdu/oL/UZ0IOoJNjqaca/UUkMfRMR6U\nejx+2HsLwiFKPujxena6LIARwxywc2U3/x+4bWkiPl72Sc4MUU81cTjykZ43r68C\n9Nu8YLF3nX7jA4NvMbAh\n=BQYI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T09:08:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/use