"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23161?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adamblum","id":23161,"login":"adamblum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/db0c910af6fe9349073183aa15e431fd66de82c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T08:42:55Z","email":"adam@healthkey.ai","name":"Adam Blum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T08:42:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Show, sort and select by suggestion confidence in Concept → Source Code (#1710)\n\n* Show, sort and select by suggestion confidence in Concept → Source Code (#1709)\n\nConfidence existed only while ranking and in note text. Store it on\nSourceCodeConceptMapping.suggestion_confidence: forward Suggest, group\nSuggest and reverse proposals write the ranker''s score for the winner,\na curator moving the destination clears it, and a migration backfills\nit from existing Suggest notes.\n\nThe concept dialog shows it in the last column for proposed rows,\norders by it from that header (server-side, unscored last), and adds\n\"Select > [80]% confidence\" beside the Source code header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Address review: winner''s own score, upload clearing, threshold rounding\n\n- Dual ranking lists the winning ranker''s alternatives first, and\n  chosen_confidence takes the first score for the winner, so a declining\n  Jev''s score is never stored as Anthropic''s pick.\n- A spreadsheet upload that moves a destination clears the confidence.\n- Select > N% compares the rounded percentage the column shows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b321541638ad3afb4e0daa5b88e69c09923afa89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/b321541638ad3afb4e0daa5b88e69c09923afa89"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/db0c910af6fe9349073183aa15e431fd66de82c0","verification":{"payload":"tree b321541638ad3afb4e0daa5b88e69c09923afa89\nparent f8ded3832b486b7e122a71bf3ce37f73af3fa480\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1791103375 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791103375 +0100\n\nShow, sort and select by suggestion confidence in Concept → Source Code (#1710)\n\n* Show, sort and select by suggestion confidence in Concept → Source Code (#1709)\n\nConfidence existed only while ranking and in note text. Store it on\nSourceCodeConceptMapping.suggestion_confidence: forward Suggest, group\nSuggest and reverse proposals write the ranker''s score for the winner,\na curator moving the destination clears it, and a migration backfills\nit from existing Suggest notes.\n\nThe concept dialog shows it in the last column for proposed rows,\norders by it from that header (server-side, unscored last), and adds\n\"Select > [80]% confidence\" beside the Source code header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Address review: winner''s own score, upload clearing, threshold rounding\n\n- Dual ranking lists the winning ranker''s alternatives first, and\n  chosen_confidence takes the first score for the winner, so a declining\n  Jev''s score is never stored as Anthropic''s pick.\n- A spreadsheet upload that moves a destination clears the confidence.\n- Select > N% compares the rounded percentage the column shows.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwhGPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAK7UQAGxNTqzb9NLR8xR5WCHpyasr\nwvxR0JdLhIkOohVUP1h303vqiMQvwNK2iHWbcreyIDZQ6TGbu6yAUqC3BCPr2Hrq\nFGrCvAEzO6TbVhuQMVmpf+WhWTACyIjfQzjdtUvkV7fe142Tjwku3i/mMncjXZzX\n+CkR0i9ozjjvDxfASgEFW++k6ZCRAehl6uoIVFNuCb3R+xkFfO+djZef+aBuUYnb\neGVSMjxwWu/tu+ViPp1kZcy1KNra+TVzoJVo8KNW/rohEI66Y0RQymyaVk6RTgTv\nSIZ81qlTZ2l8kVg3nX4B41JFLGhsbqMRPErs/fXNRqtwSB0emXgMqH7lLpa9Ihrv\nB3tFDQFJ3sPQB076j1UcBfJCrg5aTz0gSNYJVUDqEhH+TPMPd9CKRXhXfZ7yiT/Z\ng4iTrVq8EuYwhk0HirFgIgeuC+wzFx5CCgR4IoCIqLvi0Ynqny9x3a3i3mmbTr9A\nzMuDqaxh1T0zdcUuDnFuXvjGfjW/MKtIMzh70464ByxO+lM8wG4v8zgGfR3DBl2Z\nTR1p9+Z08NWmdsV5pJfK9qVi4qMQrMIWZ+mKG6jhDwQRWgtaVVqYk7np3YlFTeCK\n3/eE28Tx6snKLEDK94FRLS9DQkPUDjkRK0jny96zRFasMPat5Pb9/j/HCT3Y2i01\n6D48Xsi02Ut6NlYOWNPe\n=lBuh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T08:42:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/promop/commit/db0c910af6fe9349073183aa15e431fd66de82c0","node_id":"C_kwDOPw6uhdoAKGRiMGM5MTBhZjZmZTkzNDkwNzMxODNhYTE1ZTQzMWZkNjZkZTgyYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/promop/commit/f8ded3832b486b7e122a71bf3ce37f73af3fa480","sha":"f8ded3832b486b7e122a71bf3ce37f73af3fa480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/f8ded3832b486b7e122a71bf3ce37f73af3fa480"}],"sha":"db0c910af6fe9349073183aa15e431fd66de82c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/db0c910af6fe9349073183aa15e431fd66de82c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23161?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adamblum","id":23161,"login":"adamblum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/f8ded3832b486b7e122a71bf3ce37f73af3fa480/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T08:19:00Z","email":"adam@healthkey.ai","name":"Adam Blum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T08:19:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Seed field-mapper Suggest with searchable genomics terms (#1706)\n\n* Seed field-mapper Suggest with searchable genomics terms (#1705)\n\nSuggest searched the concept table for the raw field name, so every\nGenomics field asked for \"genomics ...\" and matched nothing. Field\ndescriptors now carry a suggest_query: the gene (\"BRCA1 gene\") or the\ncatalog label (\"t(4;14)\") for genomics_* markers, with overrides where\nthe vocabularies name a marker differently, and the attribute key for\ngenetic_mutations.* components.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Correct _suggest_query docstring on how concept search matches\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42cb12effefeb726f4ebfdf7fb36a41ac6d51c55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/42cb12effefeb726f4ebfdf7fb36a41ac6d51c55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/f8ded3832b486b7e122a71bf3ce37f73af3fa480","verification":{"payload":"tree 42cb12effefeb726f4ebfdf7fb36a41ac6d51c55\nparent ea095e6d6d93730f5dda9d91ed80d040c67a378c\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1791101940 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791101940 -0400\n\nSeed field-mapper Suggest with searchable genomics terms (#1706)\n\n* Seed field-mapper Suggest with searchable genomics terms (#1705)\n\nSuggest searched the concept table for the raw field name, so every\nGenomics field asked for \"genomics ...\" and matched nothing. Field\ndescriptors now carry a suggest_query: the gene (\"BRCA1 gene\") or the\ncatalog label (\"t(4;14)\") for genomics_* markers, with overrides where\nthe vocabularies name a marker differently, and the attribute key for\ngenetic_mutations.* components.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Correct _suggest_query docstring on how concept search matches\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwgv0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+FIQAJu1ECHSPhSl0B0X4dyXbpcx\nD0Gk/FmG9XMsa1HSOa0ccBIPuMq07O9D7m1xFtbOcQUM4ekCABkWwWajlj2WygbO\n8M0RTu4d+PvyFs3koGxXBZE5bDR6JcpdDTZQjWiqShh1rZVBSg5H9f7ZZys6Mpus\nu6f6CY2jZjpxafgwkPjNYjABwDTLSF00+RFXl0O8oSz7q9jkzqA5ENl1MMs7cEtO\nmZuXU0SwyhZWphR0skPyGwNuajlSQp083azzBLLSYQnEQVtrRIWANQqagP1D/ybB\n2+DZhWVILOzGwlxIawVggOCLBzbYQR2/vcxJS7Y3A425eyjtzaNibvgg4voZI4tF\n6WSwruwP8snePjdN5a4sl2xLrVte6sMw+uZm94ytKe0SGjg5gazAujD2JWIhxL4D\nKchHLw26B6cepnJcdNIuBDudryJLreeqbimSgLFY4NrtpDUVSIDX4JlLt1E+2IoZ\ntdU/94KkwLPZsS3fW5aRLospLJoTaoSMgIeMVcQXQDFuAoKl4RhfWItUMN479hnN\npQaXuOCwpKgx8t42m0peb94Bxghjthw3QpUJaVXKOYbfpcTA8AOjYUqXG2YBMrL7\nn0LIKHizBpiYIyIY1sYZtjM0aFsCDL0l4KS/fsokif4ZsgTzHhJdviEYTuJfWzaF\nDbVYmi7Pj5vZwpMdPNtz\n=RRk8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T08:19:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/promop/commit/f8ded3832b486b7e122a71bf3ce37f73af3fa480","node_id":"C_kwDOPw6uhdoAKGY4ZGVkMzgzMmI0ODZiN2UxMjJhNzFiZjNjZTM3ZjczYWYzZmE0ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/promop/commit/ea095e6d6d93730f5dda9d91ed80d040c67a378c","sha":"ea095e6d6d93730f5dda9d91ed80d040c67a378c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/ea095e6d6d93730f5dda9d91ed80d040c67a378c"}],"sha":"f8ded3832b486b7e122a71bf3ce37f73af3fa480","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/f8ded3832b486b7e122a71bf3ce37f73af3fa480"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23161?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adamblum","id":23161,"login":"adamblum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/ea095e6d6d93730f5dda9d91ed80d040c67a378c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T08:11:36Z","email":"adam@healthkey.ai","name":"Adam Blum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T08:11:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Make the approving curator a code mapping''s provenance (#1708)\n\n* Make the approving curator a code mapping''s provenance (#1707)\n\nApproval (and a re-point while approved) now stamps origin_system with\nthe approver''s display name, so the provenance names who owns the\nmapping. Athena-family provenance is kept: it decides the ATHENA-MAPPED\nsection and how identity rows resolve. Suggest accuracy reads\nsuggestion_outcome/suggested_target_concept, not origin_system, so model\nhistory is unaffected; an un-approved row stays out of Suggest''s\nReplace set because its provenance is no longer blank or suggest*.\n\nThe mapping dialog footer shows the current provenance on the left,\nStatus in the middle and the actions on the right.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update the provenance comment for approval stamping\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Expect the approver as provenance in the sign-off test\n\norigin stays ''import'' (it gates the re-point match set); origin_system,\nthe displayed provenance, now names the approving curator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4081766dae2727099a29ad3f7e921ef62e903fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/f4081766dae2727099a29ad3f7e921ef62e903fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/ea095e6d6d93730f5dda9d91ed80d040c67a378c","verification":{"payload":"tree f4081766dae2727099a29ad3f7e921ef62e903fd\nparent 4b65bb1fc00a7de0bf4e128b888fc2eb69cecce6\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1791101496 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791101496 -0400\n\nMake the approving curator a code mapping''s provenance (#1708)\n\n* Make the approving curator a code mapping''s provenance (#1707)\n\nApproval (and a re-point while approved) now stamps origin_system with\nthe approver''s display name, so the provenance names who owns the\nmapping. Athena-family provenance is kept: it decides the ATHENA-MAPPED\nsection and how identity rows resolve. Suggest accuracy reads\nsuggestion_outcome/suggested_target_concept, not origin_system, so model\nhistory is unaffected; an un-approved row stays out of Suggest''s\nReplace set because its provenance is no longer blank or suggest*.\n\nThe mapping dialog footer shows the current provenance on the left,\nStatus in the middle and the actions on the right.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update the provenance comment for approval stamping\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Expect the approver as provenance in the sign-off test\n\norigin stays ''import'' (it gates the re-point match set); origin_system,\nthe displayed provenance, now names the approving curator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwgo4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX7gQACUhTnpAx6DSLoWcJ1Ezr5C7\nG698Q99YL91xSnPJdUgzWOCFSGKJ06+1T9XCmIKzFnZ8YNGviCf1XHTvSIXiSY+H\nv1vYo0Wyvuy9PNLkgGzVAbwhONi5MXz9u3b98Ddau6ddLhB2aaapD26yNMy3Lwll\nyMgby1qZTogVCkjT7vOCFG3866Gl06bOAJ5tZSnMnFSLND2qCeviyuOj9Z5CqeoU\njvO94c11jqxKYrw1hYg8I+kB3xjQ9ArG4QSu0T50kvKBhop7YNJV+p6rloNexTY7\npQX52H6v2jMW2axp4UD4KO3vW5wjPbpsCZLY9kJhaalwH/8eZPt2Py1EdjfXvHnH\nMUfUosBXJClXzTl25lfSPzDwlaX1UvthYywdpcIriM1Fc6a5ORAp3l1d2O9cVftU\nfCuQvvgiZqBWrXJKO00d5KnM7XQRSv/f5kA7LBXEbc5gkykZt9VbQ753SBQJ/O6w\n0Ltv96lbNeUCHgqKF61hlKarZ8IhxekHjiuOFQWrPX4kykWZXkCQFerD+MpGzQiN\nNH5tz5vMF8+EQ7I72pBm3pP8ZqHlx2MTqbhhqGLwX71hQ/EY7mYZjoPAdeW8bVbt\n8fVrUabSS8ngS+2TFV9TR+5TXhmguECa5eUq/CHXUU1z6eIrxxdOXzd7yvG5r8WE\n/JTM2UHk6u3gQu/nZCge\n=rwiz\n-----