c2eb69cecce6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/4b65bb1fc00a7de0bf4e128b888fc2eb69cecce6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23161?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/adamblum","id":23161,"login":"adamblum","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamblum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/1101fbde3543e2d074e922488d32279bf307f158/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:28:02Z","email":"adam@healthkey.ai","name":"Adam Blum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:28:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add opt-in concept+date duplicate detection for Measurement writes (#1700)\n\n* Add opt-in concept+date duplicate detection for Measurement writes (#1699)\n\nTwo query params control the check on POST /api/v1/measurements/:\n- ?warn_concept_duplicates=true  — 201, rows written, warnings in response\n- ?reject_concept_duplicates=true — 409, batch rolled back\n\nDetects both intra-batch collisions and conflicts with existing rows.\nExcludes concept_id=0 and is_erroneous rows. One SELECT per check,\nflat in batch size (uses ix_meas_person_concept_date).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Address review feedback: 400 on non-Measurement, extra tests, comment\n\n- Return 400 when warn/reject_concept_duplicates flags are set on a\n  non-Measurement endpoint (conditions, observations, etc.)\n- Add tests: intra-batch reject, both-flags precedence, non-Measurement 400\n- Add comment documenting the cross-product query trade-off\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Adam Blum <23161+adamblum@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"acc33add52b5193f9025769b3bffa77268e855c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/acc33add52b5193f9025769b3bffa77268e855c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/1101fbde3543e2d074e922488d32279bf307f158","verification":{"payload":"tree acc33add52b5193f9025769b3bffa77268e855c5\nparent 7a3e79a64b045f4d1ec0f67ab25058e7bdb0829f\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1791030482 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791030482 -0400\n\nAdd opt-in concept+date duplicate detection for Measurement writes (#1700)\n\n* Add opt-in concept+date duplicate detection for Measurement writes (#1699)\n\nTwo query params control the check on POST /api/v1/measurements/:\n- ?warn_concept_duplicates=true  — 201, rows written, warnings in response\n- ?reject_concept_duplicates=true — 409, batch rolled back\n\nDetects both intra-batch collisions and conflicts with existing rows.\nExcludes concept_id=0 and is_erroneous rows. One SELECT per check,\nflat in batch size (uses ix_meas_person_concept_date).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Address review feedback: 400 on non-Measurement, extra tests, comment\n\n- Return 400 when warn/reject_concept_duplicates flags are set on a\n  non-Measurement endpoint (conditions, observations, etc.)\n- Add tests: intra-batch reject, both-flags precedence, non-Measurement 400\n- Add comment documenting the cross-product query trade-off\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Adam Blum <23161+adamblum@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwPTSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsakQAKZitbCXlCoR69HdwzBrcsZR\nBFClk0f7Pyu0nxxcfoEddt/xJibawyrYOSryXPuOj7zZnaVJOwtRvbzDx7AhPzjq\naa5GPrpfS9syuBbw0F9kAvMWcFzrCLZOTYaeuLqeY5HetZYCzMsKwiZb7TVZHmtP\nD1DUYbOCm797XcuKEaqsELp6iYaZP1Pr4rScVMhOW115iHwwda+9I05X6sk+8EES\nd203dcJnyH4tjX/HZR3gbkPbOm1AXuBh6h0wmydWZcNRAbgjUSwLUJjGTMEaO9vp\nnWTSx5M10eFwi5BnHH/6uBo5f54AYLQHkA4tUc8tS9I857ZIcoAQg09Cnk4F6CXY\nPSVXhCjmRyLBOD1rFNOdtvud9LO8hZlm6er6tKSrqscmaDmqEnSlIqcXfxe/W0AA\nykQ2Qmtif/5NCJxN5AjMwJEJnglLGglRk6GfIq8jFd3aydnWDZTrEkM9eq+yqspi\n0i7yAfoJeGe5KHM35Hm3MUwj0qRR0jna4eLPclJr40Cu8WZdz+36LcdERCDTK97F\nDwwH2AK16boCucBh6kVAYiDC/9lKF4N6nsOcOOdVRcRqdsIUAsnX7m2IuRERtFQl\nRludKqHOr8byNuycJ15RR2xziTDCDl65CnDbjUPgrl3t2AwORhmBlvCuAKNbcG4f\npFdyenaZw9bpFc6n/6sy\n=0GO+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-03T12:28:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type"