86f53f158e5cebf8d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69346755?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeoMo42","id":69346755,"login":"LeoMo42","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzQ2NzU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/6ef1de57f5ae758d0746ef8e8e3cbad01531db49/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:22:20Z","email":"69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com","name":"LeoMo42"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:22:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(patient-detail): ZIP autofill sends the state abbreviation, only for US patients (#1665) (#1666)\n\n* test(patient-detail): ZIP autofill must send the state abbreviation, and only for US patients (#1665)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(patient-detail): ZIP autofill sends the state abbreviation, and only for US patients (#1665)\n\nregion is projected to OMOP Location.state (two characters); the lookup''s full\nstate name made PATCH /patient-info/<id>/ answer 400 for the whole save, and the\ndiff-against-last-success kept resending it. Same rules as the widget (#1646):\ntake `state abbreviation`, leave region alone without one, and skip the US-only\nlookup when the country is set to something that is not the US (re-checked when\nthe response arrives). The country check lives in src/lib/usZip.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(patient-detail): a ZIP lookup answering after the autosave is still saved\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(patient-detail): the ZIP autofill schedules its own save (#1665)\n\nIt only rewrote pendingDataRef and rode on the keystroke''s 2s autosave; a lookup\nanswering after that timer left city/region shown and never sent. Schedule a\nsave as handleFieldChange does, instead of assigning the ref inside a setState\nupdater.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(patient-detail): a lookup answer for a superseded ZIP is dropped\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(patient-detail): drop a ZIP lookup answer for a superseded ZIP (#1665)\n\nScheduling the lookup''s own save made a late answer for a ZIP the user had\nsince replaced persist every time: Beverly Hills / CA next to 10001. Check the\nZIP is still the current one, as the widget does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0fabfe9ed9a9bed4f2883a5e5683f5d5b1977324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/0fabfe9ed9a9bed4f2883a5e5683f5d5b1977324"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/6ef1de57f5ae758d0746ef8e8e3cbad01531db49","verification":{"payload":"tree 0fabfe9ed9a9bed4f2883a5e5683f5d5b1977324\nparent 9df23fb922cefa6aafb95fe9161585fe75eb5d72\nauthor LeoMo42 <69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com> 1790778140 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790778140 +0300\n\nfix(patient-detail): ZIP autofill sends the state abbreviation, only for US patients (#1665) (#1666)\n\n* test(patient-detail): ZIP autofill must send the state abbreviation, and only for US patients (#1665)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(patient-detail): ZIP autofill sends the state abbreviation, and only for US patients (#1665)\n\nregion is projected to OMOP Location.state (two characters); the lookup''s full\nstate name made PATCH /patient-info/<id>/ answer 400 for the whole save, and the\ndiff-against-last-success kept resending it. Same rules as the widget (#1646):\ntake `state abbreviation`, leave region alone without one, and skip the US-only\nlookup when the country is set to something that is not the US (re-checked when\nthe response arrives). The country check lives in src/lib/usZip.ts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(patient-detail): a ZIP lookup answering after the autosave is still saved\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(patient-detail): the ZIP autofill schedules its own save (#1665)\n\nIt only rewrote pendingDataRef and rode on the keystroke''s 2s autosave; a lookup\nanswering after that timer left city/region shown and never sent. Schedule a\nsave as handleFieldChange does, instead of assigning the ref inside a setState\nupdater.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(patient-detail): a lookup answer for a superseded ZIP is dropped\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(patient-detail): drop a ZIP lookup answer for a superseded ZIP (#1665)\n\nScheduling the lookup''s own save made a late answer for a ZIP the user had\nsince replaced persist every time: Beverly Hills / CA next to 10001. Check the\nZIP is still the current one, as the widget does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvRscCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOigQAIidtgR0t0vIy4JFMM76L1bu\nHcV6G8942IdCOvBNGMHGU5F311bnSEYhCjZXmJiqjliY