m/users/adamblum","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/commits/bab3b10d73c3f62f92fa5ba43d9ebbd2f3f2dce7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T07:36:33Z","email":"adam@healthkey.ai","name":"Adam Blum"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T07:36:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Remove the shadowed has_professional_access definition (#1599) (#1620)\n\naccess.py defined has_professional_access twice with byte-identical\nbodies; Python bound the second. Keep that one: its docstring (only org\nadmins and staff approve) matches _can_approve_mappings, which is what\ngates approval. The deleted first docstring left the approval rule\nambiguous. No behaviour change.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae8b64c14ea7490fa93882f1160b69224a84c6fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/trees/ae8b64c14ea7490fa93882f1160b69224a84c6fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/promop/git/commits/bab3b10d73c3f62f92fa5ba43d9ebbd2f3f2dce7","verification":{"payload":"tree ae8b64c14ea7490fa93882f1160b69224a84c6fc\nparent dbb5e5d73410cd84d6b7996c2800293f4e56c036\nauthor Adam Blum <adam@healthkey.ai> 1790494593 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790494593 -0400\n\nRemove the shadowed has_professional_access definition (#1599) (#1620)\n\naccess.py defined has_professional_access twice with byte-identical\nbodies; Python bound the second. Keep that one: its docstring (only org\nadmins and staff approve) matches _can_approve_mappings, which is what\ngates approval. The deleted first docstring left the approval rule\nambiguous. No behaviour change.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquMeBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATA0QAEEMxDT178apbZFUOHLyZ8Tj\nhe5j5dKkYbXM8eNPO0Tgc/Cj7mNpHthKjXuhUfKJ/A8DXFvUKzpv