ank3778/MFE/commits/7fccf7794ce8c8d94244bc9814bad5d5bebef032/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-01T05:11:52Z","email":"samuel@opencraft.com","name":"Samuel Allan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-12T17:21:20Z","email":"arbrandes@arbrand.es","name":"Adolfo R. Brandes"},"message":"fix: update frontend-build to fix install issues\n\nEarlier versions of @openedx/frontend-build used on older version of\n''sharp'', which caused intermittent installation issues. The version of\n''sharp'' was updated in @openedx/frontend-build to fix these issues, so\nthe frontend-build version can be updated here, to fix the issues in\nthis project too. See\nhttps://github.com/openedx/frontend-build/issues/664 and\nhttps://github.com/openedx/frontend-build/pull/665 for more information.\n\nThe frontend-build dependency was updated by:\n\n```\nnpm install --package-lock-only @openedx/frontend-build\n```\n\nPrivate-ref: https://tasks.opencraft.com/browse/BB-9953","tree":{"sha":"11dcb518a29b3644719683108ff598f5f7714c80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shashank3778/MFE/git/trees/11dcb518a29b3644719683108ff598f5f7714c80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shashank3778/MFE/git/commits/7fccf7794ce8c8d94244bc9814bad5d5bebef032","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/759355?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/arbrandes","id":759355,"login":"arbrandes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTM1NQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arbrandes/received_events","repos_url"