"2025-09-18T01:18:14Z","email":"votoznotna@gmail.com","name":"Anton Zotov"},"message":"Initial commit: React Module Federation with version agnostic microfrontends\n\n- Implemented React 18 federated module with shareable components\n- Created React 18 host app with direct Module Federation\n- Built React 19 host app with multiple loading strategies\n- Added Simple Fallback Pattern as recommended solution\n- Included Docker support with docker-compose\n- Comprehensive documentation and quick start guide\n- Multiple microfrontend frameworks (Single-SPA, Qiankun, Micro-App)\n- Error boundary patterns and graceful degradation\n- TypeScript support throughout\n- Production-ready fallback strategy for React version conflicts","tree":{"sha":"5394f927bb12232288fff73f7dc4c43cb41bed9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/votoznotna/react-module-federation/git/trees/5394f927bb12232288fff73f7dc4c43cb41bed9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/votoznotna/react-module-federation/git/commits/44d5090ea74af1f35c88264bd77ec7bd09e722b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6313744?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votoznotna/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votoznotna/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votoznotna/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votoznotna/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/votoznotna","id":6313744,"login":"votoznotna","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMTM3NDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votoznotna/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votoznotna/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votoznotna/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/votoznotna/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/voto