se,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/a206e51bbb2c8566ad303818213569268393bc82","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKGEyMDZlNTFiYmIyYzg1NjZhZDMwMzgxODIxMzU2OTI2ODM5M2JjODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/3b6ee39247e4327d30be3c56a408593c743593a7","sha":"3b6ee39247e4327d30be3c56a408593c743593a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/3b6ee39247e4327d30be3c56a408593c743593a7"}],"sha":"a206e51bbb2c8566ad303818213569268393bc82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/a206e51bbb2c8566ad303818213569268393bc82"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/3b6ee39247e4327d30be3c56a408593c743593a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-05T16:35:27Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-05T16:35:27Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"fix(scripts): resolve exit code 1 on successful builds - complete fix\n\nISSUE: Build script returns exit code 1 even on successful builds, blocking\nCI/CD workflows and deployment.\n\nROOT CAUSE: Functions ending with conditional statements (e.g.,\n`[[ condition ]] && action`) implicitly return exit code of last command.\nWhen condition is FALSE in normal scenarios (like DEBUG_MODE=false, CI=false),\nthese functions return 1 instead of 0.\n\nSOLUTION: Conducted comprehensive audit of all 63 functions across 4 scripts\n(error-handling.sh, build.sh, cache.sh, performance.sh). Added explicit\n`return 0` statements to 9 problematic functions.\n\nCHANGES:\n\nscripts/error-handling.sh (5 functions fixed):\n- cleanup_error_handling (line 468): Added return 0\n- log_structured (line 151): Added return 0\n- preserve_error_state (line 266): Added return 0\n- init_error_handling (line 446): Added return 0\n- enter_function (line 47): Added return 0\n- set_error_context (line 60): Added return 0\n- log_verbose (line 185): Added return 0\n\nscripts/build.sh (2 functions fixed):\n- main (line 1179): Added return 0\n- log_verbose (lines 107, 109): Added return 0 after early return and at end\n\ndocs/proposals/22-build-script-returns-exit-code-1/:\n- 002-complete-audit.md: Complete audit report with all 63 functions analyzed\n\nTESTING:\n✅ Local build with --debug --no-cache: Exit code 0\n✅ Hugo build completes successfully\n✅ Cache system works correctly\n✅ Error handling preserved\n\nVERIFICATION:\nBefore: ./scripts/build.sh [args] → exit code 1 ❌\nAfter:  ./scripts/build.sh [args] → exit code 0 ✅\n\nFixes #22\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db22bea5b3a056974d38faa5ec6860d811b0890e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/db22bea5b3a056974d38faa5ec6860d811b0890e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/3b6ee39247e4327d30be3c56a408593c743593a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/3b6ee39247e4327d30be3c56a408593c743593a7","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKDNiNmVlMzkyNDdlNDMyN2QzMGJlM2M1NmE0MDg1OTNjNzQzNTkzYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/bbc422100c7f5dfe93bbdba751fa1ca483eff387","sha":"bbc422100c7f5dfe93bbdba751fa1ca483eff387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/bbc422100c7f5dfe93bbdba751fa1ca483eff387"}],"sha":"3b6ee39247e4327d30be3c56a408593c743593a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/3b6ee39247e4327d30be3c56a408593c743593a7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/bbc422100c7f5dfe93bbdba751fa1ca483eff387/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-05T16:08:31Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-05T16:08:31Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"fix(exit-code): add explicit return 0 to 5 critical functions\n\nFix implicit return code bug affecting script exit codes.\nAdd explicit `return 0` to functions that could return non-zero\nexit codes in normal successful operation due to ending with\nconditional statements that evaluate to FALSE.\n\nFunctions Fixed (Priority 1-2 from audit):\n\n1. cleanup_error_handling() [CRITICAL]\n   - scripts/error-handling.sh:463\n   - Called at end of main(), became script exit code\n   - Last if statement returned 1 when ERROR_STATE_FILE missing\n\n2. main() [CRITICAL]\n   - scripts/build.sh:1179\n   - Last function in script, no explicit return after cleanup\n   - Propagated cleanup_error_handling''s exit code\n\n3. log_structured() [HIGH RISK]\n   - scripts/error-handling.sh:151\n   - Used by ALL logging functions throughout codebase\n   - Returned 1 when LOG_FILE not set (common scenario)\n\n4. preserve_error_state() [HIGH RISK]\n   - scripts/error-handling.sh:266\n   - Called in error paths\n   - Returned 1 in non-CI environments (local builds)\n\n5. init_error_handling() [MEDIUM-HIGH RISK]\n   - scripts/error-handling.sh:446\n   - Called at script start\n   - Depended on log_structured return value\n\nRoot Cause: Bash functions return exit code of last command.\nIf last command is conditional that evaluates FALSE, function\nreturns 1, even if operation succeeded.\n\nImpact: Primary bug (cleanup_error_handling) caused successful\nbuilds to return exit code 1, failing GitHub Actions workflows.\n\nTesting: Local tests and CI workflow validation pending.\n\nFixes #22","tree":{"sha":"d7481d34e25bf239f48322cc0fd2d473b4fd10a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/d7481d34e25bf239f48322cc0fd2d473b4fd10a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/bbc422100c7f5dfe93bbdba751fa1ca483eff387","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/bbc422100c7f5dfe93bbdba751fa1ca483eff387","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKGJiYzQyMjEwMGM3ZjVkZmU5M2JiZGJhNzUxZmExY2E0ODNlZmYzODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/0dcb2d234b04bea5ca5869f975a16e490f21c5e7","sha":"0dcb2d234b04bea5ca5869f975a16e490f21c5e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/0dcb2d234b04bea5ca5869f975a16e490f21c5e7"}],"sha":"bbc422100c7f5dfe93bbdba751fa1ca483eff387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/bbc422100c7f5dfe93bbdba751fa1ca483eff387"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/0dcb2d234b04bea5ca5869f975a16e490f21c5e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-05T16:06:19Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-05T16:06:19Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"docs(issue-22): Step 2.0 complete - function audit results\n\nSystematic audit of all functions in error-handling.sh and build.sh\ncompleted. Found 9 functions with missing explicit return statements.\n\nCRITICAL Findings (Priority 1):\n- cleanup_error_handling(): Returns 1 when ERROR_STATE_FILE missing\n- main(): No return after cleanup_error_handling call\n\nHIGH Risk (Priority 2):\n- log_structured(): Returns 1 when LOG_FILE not set\n- preserve_error_state(): Returns 1 in non-CI environments\n- init_error_handling(): Depends on log_structured\n\nMEDIUM Risk (Priority 3 - defer to future):\n- log_success(), log_verbose(), enter_function(), set_error_context()\n\nRoot Cause Pattern:\nFunctions ending with conditional statements that evaluate FALSE\nin normal operation. In Bash, functions return exit code of last\ncommand, so FALSE condition = exit code 1.\n\nImpact Analysis:\n- PRIMARY BUG: cleanup_error_handling at end of main()\n- WIDESPREAD: log_structured used by ALL logging functions\n- ERROR PATHS: preserve_error_state could mask real errors\n\nDecision: Fix 5 functions (Priority 1-2) in this stage.\n\nFull audit table with risk assessment in 002-progress.md.\n\nRelated: #22","tree":{"sha":"44e7f599ed94aa1657d537a837b753af65595d06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/44e7f599ed94aa1657d537a837b753af65595d06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/0dcb2d234b04bea5ca5869f975a16e490f21c5e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/0dcb2d234b04bea5ca5869f975a16e490f21c5e7","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKDBkY2IyZDIzNGIwNGJlYTVjYTU4NjlmOTc1YTE2ZTQ5MGYyMWM1ZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/e551100de37d9c39c25a11676e340166e2880aab","sha":"e551100de37d9c39c25a11676e340166e2880aab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/e551100de37d9c39c25a11676e340166e2880aab"}],"sha":"0dcb2d234b04bea5ca5869f975a16e490f21c5e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/0dcb2d234b04bea5ca5869f975a16e490f21c5e7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/e551100de37d9c39c25a11676e340166e2880aab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-05T16:01:44Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-05T16:01:44Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"docs(issue-22): add Step 2.0 - audit all functions for similar issues\n\nUpdate Stage 2 plan to include systematic audit of all functions\nbefore implementing fixes.\n\nAdded Step 2.0: Audit All Functions\n- Check all functions in error-handling.sh and build.sh\n- Identify functions ending with conditionals without explicit return\n- Create risk assessment table for each function\n- Prioritize fixes: Critical > High > Medium > Low\n- Look for: conditional endings, test commands, potential failures\n\nRationale:\nThe bug in cleanup_error_handling() could exist in other functions.\nRather than fix one symptom, audit entire codebase to find and fix\nall similar issues, preventing future bugs.\n\nUpdated:\n- Risks: Added \"Additional functions have same bug\" (30% likelihood)\n- Timeline: +15 min for audit (total ~70 min)\n- Deliverables: Function audit table in 002-progress.md\n- Definition of Done: Audit completed, all problems documented\n\nThis follows proper engineering practice: find root cause pattern,\nnot just individual symptom.\n\nRelated: #22","tree":{"sha":"9d6ea21cac213297d72d105d9f0ab0295ceafff4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/9d6ea21cac213297d72d105d9f0ab0295ceafff4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/e551100de37d9c39c25a11676e340166e2880aab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/e551100de37d9c39c25a11676e340166e2880aab","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKGU1NTExMDBkZTM3ZDljMzljMjVhMTE2NzZlMzQwMTY2ZTI4ODBhYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/5a3095aaf892b7a589c446a8def6481cf1930a02","sha":"5a3095aaf892b7a589c446a8def6481cf1930a02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/5a3095aaf892b7a589c446a8def6481cf1930a02"}],"sha":"e551100de37d9c39c25a11676e340166e2880aab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/e551100de37d9c39c25a11676e340166e2880aab"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/5a3095aaf892b7a589c446a8def6481cf1930a02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-05T15:55:44Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-05T15:55:44Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"docs(issue-22): add Stage 2 fix implementation plan\n\n- Create detailed plan for fixing cleanup_error_handling function\n- Propose adding explicit \"return 0\" at end of function (line 457)\n- Define 3-stage testing: local builds, cache tests, error handling validation\n- Include rollback plan if hypothesis proves incorrect\n- Document alternative solutions considered and rejected\n- Define success criteria and validation plan\n\nFix Rationale:\nFunction lacks explicit return statement. In Bash, functions return\nexit code of last command. When ERROR_STATE_FILE doesn''t exist (normal\nin successful builds), the last if statement evaluates to FALSE,\nreturning exit code 1, which propagates to script exit code.\n\nSolution: Add \"return 0\" to explicitly indicate successful cleanup.\n\nTesting Plan:\n1. Local: successful build, cached build, intentional error\n2. CI/CD: trigger workflow and verify exit code 0\n3. Validation: compare before/after workflow runs\n\nRollback: Revert commit if hypothesis incorrect or side effects found.\n\nConfidence: 95% - Code analysis clear, fix minimal and surgical.\n\nRelated: #22","tree":{"sha":"9667fa6d7e7af13af8fc0c2e7dbec279446007c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/9667fa6d7e7af13af8fc0c2e7dbec279446007c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/5a3095aaf892b7a589c446a8def6481cf1930a02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/5a3095aaf892b7a589c446a8def6481cf1930a02","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKDVhMzA5NWFhZjg5MmI3YTU4OWM0NDZhOGRlZjY0ODFjZjE5MzBhMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/49c71192376d74d7f7139e60a9f02e1ad3892910","sha":"49c71192376d74d7f7139e60a9f02e1ad3892910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/49c71192376d74d7f7139e60a9f02e1ad3892910"}],"sha":"5a3095aaf892b7a589c446a8def6481cf1930a02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/5a3095aaf892b7a589c446a8def6481cf1930a02"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/49c71192376d74d7f7139e60a9f02e1ad3892910/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-05T15:48:49Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-05T15:48:49Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"docs(issue-22): Stage 1 complete - bug reproduced and root cause identified\n\n- Triggered corporate site workflow (run #18260908885)\n- Confirmed Hugo build succeeds but workflow fails with exit code 1\n- Analyzed execution flow after \"Hugo build completed\"\n- **ROOT CAUSE FOUND**: cleanup_error_handling() missing explicit return 0\n\nTechnical Details:\n- Function: scripts/error-handling.sh:441-457 (cleanup_error_handling)\n- Problem: No explicit return statement\n- Impact: Returns exit code of last command (if statement = 1 when false)\n- Solution: Add \"return 0\" at end of function (line 457)\n\nIn successful builds (ERROR_COUNT=0), the last if statement checks\nif ERROR_STATE_FILE exists. When it doesn''t (normal case), the if\nreturns FALSE (exit code 1), which becomes the function''s return value,\nthen main()''s return value, then the script''s exit code.\n\nEvidence: 001-progress.md with workflow URL, logs, and code analysis.\nUpdated progress.md diagram: Stage 1 ✅ Complete\n\nStage 2 (detailed log analysis) SKIPPED - root cause already clear.\nReady for fix implementation.\n\nRelated: #22, Workflow: https://github.com/info-tech-io/info-tech-io.github.io/actions/runs/18260908885","tree":{"sha":"716a63859fe0a7052548f0b255796410ed550d25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/716a63859fe0a7052548f0b255796410ed550d25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/49c71192376d74d7f7139e60a9f02e1ad3892910","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/49c71192376d74d7f7139e60a9f02e1ad3892910","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKDQ5YzcxMTkyMzc2ZDc0ZDdmNzEzOWU2MGE5ZjAyZTFhZDM4OTI5MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/748c7c6ee9db4c71f1477f609db1efed973a8fb0","sha":"748c7c6ee9db4c71f1477f609db1efed973a8fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/748c7c6ee9db4c71f1477f609db1efed973a8fb0"}],"sha":"49c71192376d74d7f7139e60a9f02e1ad3892910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/49c71192376d74d7f7139e60a9f02e1ad3892910"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/748c7c6ee9db4c71f1477f609db1efed973a8fb0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-05T15:43:45Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-05T15:43:45Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"docs(issue-22): add Stage 1 detailed reproduction plan\n\n- Create 001-reproduction.md with step-by-step reproduction procedure\n- Plan: trigger deploy-corporate.yml workflow in info-tech-io.github.io\n- Define success criteria: build succeeds but workflow fails with exit 1\n- Prepare evidence collection strategy (logs, URLs, metrics)\n- Add 001-progress.md for results documentation\n-