Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-03T13:50:44Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"fix(cache): include content parameter in cache key generation\n\nAdd $CONTENT variable to config_hash calculation in both\ncheck_build_cache() and store_build_cache() functions.\n\nThis ensures cache keys differ when --content parameter changes,\npreventing cache hits from serving wrong content.\n\nRoot cause: Cache key generation at lines 729 and 768 did not\ninclude CONTENT variable, causing cache to ignore content source\nchanges.\n\nChanges:\n- scripts/build.sh:729 - Add ${CONTENT} to config_hash in check_build_cache()\n- scripts/build.sh:768 - Add ${CONTENT} to config_hash in store_build_cache()\n\nTesting:\n- Bash syntax check: passed\n- Hash calculation logic: verified\n- Different content paths produce different keys\n- Same content path produces same key (cache reuse works)\n\nFixes #14","tree":{"sha":"845d1ed0d92b90298092493cac2f6562911bce08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/845d1ed0d92b90298092493cac2f6562911bce08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/607141700410d6b35423cb6b52b9448ad7e0b600","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/607141700410d6b35423cb6b52b9448ad7e0b600","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKDYwNzE0MTcwMDQxMGQ2YjM1NDIzY2I2YjUyYjk0NDhhZDdlMGI2MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/7253ebc30eb74ac9de5a04a59a7e70d2584fd4f5","sha":"7253ebc30eb74ac9de5a04a59a7e70d2584fd4f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/7253ebc30eb74ac9de5a04a59a7e70d2584fd4f5"}],"sha":"607141700410d6b35423cb6b52b9448ad7e0b600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/607141700410d6b35423cb6b52b9448ad7e