visual tracking for:\n- Epic and Child Issues progress (20% complete, 1/5 issues done)\n- Feature branch strategy and integration workflow\n- Development timeline with parallel work phases\n- Real-time status dashboard and health metrics\n\nSupports GitHub Project Board: https://github.com/orgs/info-tech-io/projects/1","tree":{"sha":"57dbb21b3ae4b37457a443f8f23cb118756e0c09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/57dbb21b3ae4b37457a443f8f23cb118756e0c09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/ecf8eaab6bef1a8b0038d080f040978668ff856b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/ecf8eaab6bef1a8b0038d080f040978668ff856b","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKGVjZjhlYWFiNmJlZjFhOGIwMDM4ZDA4MGYwNDA5Nzg2NjhmZjg1NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5","sha":"1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5"}],"sha":"ecf8eaab6bef1a8b0038d080f040978668ff856b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/ecf8eaab6bef1a8b0038d080f040978668ff856b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/a235533e76b54af285b7b8acacfb0bc625957dc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-27T08:02:47Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-27T08:02:47Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"feat: implement comprehensive error handling system v2.0\n\n## Summary\nImplements comprehensive error handling system addressing all identified\nstability issues in build.sh. This foundational enhancement provides\nrobust diagnostics, GitHub Actions integration, and systematic error\nmanagement.\n\n## Key Features Added\n\n### 1. Structured Error Handling System\n- Hierarchical error levels (DEBUG, INFO, WARN, ERROR, FATAL)\n- Error categorization (CONFIG, DEPENDENCY, BUILD, IO, VALIDATION)\n- Function entry/exit tracking for debugging\n- Error context preservation and tracing\n\n### 2. Enhanced Logging Infrastructure\n- Structured logging with timestamps and context\n- GitHub Actions annotations integration\n- Color-coded terminal output\n- Optional file logging support\n- Backward compatibility with existing log functions\n\n### 3. Comprehensive Error Diagnostics\n- Error state preservation in JSON format\n- System environment capture for debugging\n- Build state snapshot during failures\n- Recovery suggestions and actionable messages\n\n### 4. Safe Execution Wrappers\n- safe_execute() for command execution with error handling\n- safe_node_parse() for Node.js operations with validation\n- safe_file_operation() for file system operations\n\n### 5. GitHub Actions Integration\n- ::error, ::warning, ::notice annotations\n- File and line number reporting\n- Structured output for CI/CD processing\n\n## Critical Fixes Applied\n\n### load_module_config()\n- Enhanced Node.js JSON parsing with detailed error reporting\n- Comprehensive validation of configuration structure\n- Clear error messages for JSON syntax issues\n- Proper cleanup of temporary files\n\n### parse_components()\n- Robust YAML component processing\n- Non-fatal error handling for optional components\n- Template directory validation\n- Enhanced Node.js parser integration\n\n### show_build_summary()\n- Safe file counting and size calculation\n- Graceful handling of missing directories\n- Error/warning count reporting\n- Exit code stability improvements\n\n## Testing Results\n✅ Syntax validation passed\n✅ Help command functionality confirmed\n✅ Error scenarios properly handled (nonexistent template)\n✅ Debug mode shows detailed tracing\n✅ Full build test successful (115 HTML files generated)\n✅ Corporate template builds without exit code issues\n\n## Files Modified\n- scripts/build.sh: Integrated error handling system\n- scripts/error-handling.sh: New comprehensive error handling module\n- docs/error-handling-design.md: Architecture documentation\n\n## Backward Compatibility\nAll existing log functions maintained as aliases. No breaking changes\nfor existing scripts or templates.\n\nCloses: Part of #3 (Error Handling System)\nRelated: #2 (Epic: Build System v2.0)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f46a0d687404cddee0296e176ac7962ee7275c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/4f46a0d687404cddee0296e176ac7962ee7275c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/a235533e76b54af285b7b8acacfb0bc625957dc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/a235533e76b54af285b7b8acacfb0bc625957dc5","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKGEyMzU1MzNlNzZiNTRhZjI4NWI3YjhhY2FjZmIwYmM2MjU5NTdkYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5","sha":"1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5"}],"sha":"a235533e76b54af285b7b8acacfb0bc625957dc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/a235533e76b54af285b7b8acacfb0bc625957dc5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-27T06:27:05Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-27T06:27:05Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"Fix exit code 1 in show_build_summary function\n\n🐛 Fixed workflow failure caused by find command exit code\n- Added ''|| true'' to find command in verbose file listing\n- Prevents script termination due to set -euo pipefail\n- Build process completes successfully but exit code was 1\n\nThis resolves GitHub Actions workflow failure while preserving\nall build functionality and verbose output.\n\nFixes: GitHub Actions exit code 1 after successful Hugo build\nImpact: Enables proper GitHub Pages deployment\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7dc4df2663e0be6ffa1e58187329a19430327516","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/7dc4df2663e0be6ffa1e58187329a19430327516"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKDFmYWZhYzA3MjhmMjEzNmRlY2FiY2JmMjIzNDU1NDU0YzJkYThiZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/0629d0380766791f61711205a5fc20f59f64a451","sha":"0629d0380766791f61711205a5fc20f59f64a451","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/0629d0380766791f61711205a5fc20f59f64a451"}],"sha":"1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/1fafac0728f2136decabcbf223455454c2da8be5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/0629d0380766791f61711205a5fc20f59f64a451/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-27T05:54:54Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-27T05:54:54Z","email":"claude@infotecha.ru","name":"Claude-InfoTech"},"message":"Fix JavaScript syntax error in build.sh module.json parser\n\n🐛 Fixed critical build failure caused by bash syntax in JavaScript\n- Removed invalid bash conditionals inside JavaScript code\n- Component parsing was failing due to syntax error in lines 228-239\n- Build process now completes successfully for corporate template\n\nThe issue was mixing bash syntax `[ -z \"$COMPONENTS\" ]; then` inside JavaScript code,\ncausing Node.js parsing to fail and breaking the entire build pipeline.\n\n✅ Tested: Corporate site now builds successfully\n🎯 Impact: Fixes GitHub Pages deployment failures\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b4487b115af628e3a180e6b40e6beb0bfff056f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/3b4487b115af628e3a180e6b40e6beb0bfff056f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/0629d0380766791f61711205a5fc20f59f64a451","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/0629d0380766791f61711205a5fc20f59f64a451","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKDA2MjlkMDM4MDc2Njc5MWY2MTcxMTIwNWE1ZmMyMGY1OWY2NGE0NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/c33c8388bbacb83a04e395b2fcddb29c4631e8e2","sha":"c33c8388bbacb83a04e395b2fcddb29c4631e8e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/c33c8388bbacb83a04e395b2fcddb29c4631e8e2"}],"sha":"0629d0380766791f61711205a5fc20f59f64a451","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/0629d0380766791f61711205a5fc20f59f64a451"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/c33c8388bbacb83a04e395b2fc