T instead of OUTPUT/public\n- This fixes the nested public/public/ structure reported in CI/CD testing\n\nFixes: #hugo-templates-path-issue","tree":{"sha":"7d62d4b4546b75a56090446fe35cf30e76317fc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/7d62d4b4546b75a56090446fe35cf30e76317fc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/5f85b5771bb9ea37c23d1e689de511725b38bd78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/5f85b5771bb9ea37c23d1e689de511725b38bd78","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKDVmODViNTc3MWJiOWVhMzdjMjNkMWU2ODlkZTUxMTcyNWIzOGJkNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/dec2ec334745cbf80d825f59478865ac29e0534a","sha":"dec2ec334745cbf80d825f59478865ac29e0534a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/dec2ec334745cbf80d825f59478865ac29e0534a"}],"sha":"5f85b5771bb9ea37c23d1e689de511725b38bd78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/5f85b5771bb9ea37c23d1e689de511725b38bd78"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/dec2ec334745cbf80d825f59478865ac29e0534a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-19T13:55:08Z","email":"diagnostic@infotecha.ru","name":"InfoTech.io Diagnostic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-19T13:55:08Z","email":"diagnostic@infotecha.ru","name":"InfoTech.io Diagnostic"},"message":"Implement Stage 3: Complete CLI automation and advanced tooling\n\nThis commit implements comprehensive CLI automation with dual interface\napproach (bash + Node.js), advanced validation, logging, and diagnostic\ncapabilities for the Hugo Template Factory Framework.\n\nKey Features:\n• Dual Interface CLI: bash scripts + Node.js wrapper for cross-platform support\n• Advanced build automation with full parameterization\n• Comprehensive validation system with detailed JSON Schema checking\n• Rich utility suite: list, generate, validate, diagnostic tools\n• Centralized logging system with performance monitoring\n• System diagnostic tools for debugging and troubleshooting\n\nCLI Capabilities:\n• Full build automation: ./scripts/build.sh --template=default --theme=compose\n• Template generation: ./scripts/generate.js template my-blog --type educational\n• Project validation: ./scripts/validate.js --template default\n• Resource listing: ./scripts/list.js templates\n• System diagnostics: ./scripts/diagnostic.js --verbose\n\nTechnical Implementation:\n• Bash scripts with comprehensive error handling and progress tracking\n• Node.js wrapper providing npm ecosystem integration\n• JSON Schema validation for templates, components, and build configurations\n• Centralized logger with multiple output levels and file logging\n• Performance monitoring with memory tracking and timing\n• Cross-platform compatibility (Linux/macOS via bash, Windows via Node.js)\n\nThis completes Stage 3 ahead of schedule with significant feature expansion\nbeyond original requirements, providing a production-ready CLI automation\nsuite for the Hugo Template Factory Framework.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2544cc3b0948b3e231907b0e6a50299e881d54ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/2544cc3b0948b3e231907b0e6a50299e881d54ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/dec2ec334745cbf80d825f59478865ac29e0534a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/dec2ec334745cbf80d825f59478865ac29e0534a","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKGRlYzJlYzMzNDc0NWNiZjgwZDgyNWY1OTQ3ODg2NWFjMjllMDUzNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/6205e68dcdfd12fdc060fdddf33973adb7aabfea","sha":"6205e68dcdfd12fdc060fdddf33973adb7aabfea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/6205e68dcdfd12fdc060fdddf33973adb7aabfea"}],"sha":"dec2ec334745cbf80d825f59478865ac29e0534a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/dec2ec334745cbf80d825f59478865ac29e0534a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/6205e68dcdfd12fdc060fdddf33973adb7aabfea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-18T12:41:46Z","email":"diagnostic@infotecha.ru","name":"InfoTech.io Diagnostic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-18T12:41:46Z","email":"diagnostic@infotecha.ru","name":"InfoTech.io Diagnostic"},"message":"Implement Stage 2: Core Hugo Template Factory functionality\n\n✅ Build System Implementation:\n- Full parametric build functionality with component processing\n- Support for default and minimal templates\n- Git submodules integration for themes and components\n- Hugo configuration management and optimization\n\n✅ Template System:\n- Default template: Full-featured with Quiz Engine integration\n- Minimal template: Optimized for performance (11% smaller output)\n- Component-based architecture with conditional inclusion\n- YAML-based configuration (components.yml)\n\n✅ Git Submodules:\n- themes/compose: Hugo theme integration\n- components/quiz-engine: Interactive testing system\n- Automatic initialization and management\n\n✅ CLI Enhancement:\n- Working build command with verbose output and validation\n- Component processing and theme copying\n- Build statistics and performance metrics\n- Cross-module compatibility testing\n\n✅ Validation & Testing:\n- Successfully tested with mod_linux_base, mod_linux_advanced, mod_linux_professional\n- Validated CLI commands (build, list, validate)\n- Performance comparison between templates\n- Full integration with existing info-tech-io ecosystem\n\n🚀 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a40887ff86ba6e26855fda9544a2b6a94f4e5b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/a40887ff86ba6e26855fda9544a2b6a94f4e5b15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/6205e68dcdfd12fdc060fdddf33973adb7aabfea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/6205e68dcdfd12fdc060fdddf33973adb7aabfea","node_id":"C_kwDOPyK4E9oAKDYyMDVlNjhkY2RmZDEyZmRjMDYwZmRkZGYzMzk3M2FkYjdhYWJmZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commit/2c9cbd7282eb1399aac1355a6275f6956b89670b","sha":"2c9cbd7282eb1399aac1355a6275f6956b89670b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/2c9cbd7282eb1399aac1355a6275f6956b89670b"}],"sha":"6205e68dcdfd12fdc060fdddf33973adb7aabfea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/6205e68dcdfd12fdc060fdddf33973adb7aabfea"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/commits/2c9cbd7282eb1399aac1355a6275f6956b89670b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-18T06:40:09Z","email":"diagnostic@infotecha.ru","name":"InfoTech.io Diagnostic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-18T06:40:09Z","email":"diagnostic@infotecha.ru","name":"InfoTech.io Diagnostic"},"message":"Initial Hugo Template Factory Framework structure","tree":{"sha":"3c7b28b5df68e2d8cb4084d4d64e7d8d5c9079c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/trees/3c7b28b5df68e2d8cb4084d4d64e7d8d5c9079c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/info-tech-io/hugo-templates/git/commits/2c9cbd7282eb1399aac1355a6275f6956b89670b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature"